ature/pillar grids. For a loud full-accent fill with contrast ink, stamp cellStyle:'solid' per cell instead.",cellOptions:{cellStyle:"subtle"},minItems:2,legacyVariant:"solidBoxes"},"outline-boxes":{description:"Boxes with a thin outline and no fill — a lighter-weight box grid than solid-boxes.",cellOptions:{cellStyle:"outline"},minItems:2,legacyVariant:"outlineBoxes"},"side-line":{description:"A thick accent rule down each item's leading edge — editorial emphasis without full boxes.",cellOptions:{border:{style:"solid",sides:"left",width:"lg"}},minItems:2,legacyVariant:"sideLineText"},"top-line":{description:"A thick accent rule across the top of each item — column headers without full boxes.",cellOptions:{border:{style:"solid",sides:"top",width:"lg"}},minItems:2,legacyVariant:"topLineText"},"process-steps":{description:"Sequential steps: a muted auto-number (01, 02, …) above an accent rule on each item — renumbers on reorder.",gridOptions:{marker:{type:"number",placement:{position:"above",align:"start"},rule:!0},markerNumbering:{format:"decimal-leading-zero"}},gridCssVars:{"--marker-gap":"0.6em"},minItems:2,legacyVariant:"processSteps"},"leaf-boxes":{description:"Muted-fill boxes with leaf-shaped corners (rounded top-left/bottom-right) — an organic take on solid-boxes. cellStyle:'solid' swaps in the full-accent fill.",cellOptions:{cellStyle:"subtle",borderRadius:[32,0,32,0]},minItems:2,legacyVariant:"solidLeafBoxes"},"big-bullets":{description:"A large auto-number in a subtle rounded chip beside each item — prominent ordered lists that renumber on reorder.",gridOptions:{marker:{type:"number",size:"large",style:"subtle",shape:"rounded",placement:{position:"inline"}}},gridCssVars:v,minItems:2,legacyVariant:"bigBullets"},"small-bullets":{description:"A small bullet dot beside each item — compact unordered feature lists.",gridOptions:{marker:{type:"bullet",size:"small"}},gridCssVars:v,minItems:2,legacyVariant:"smallBullets"},"arrow-bullets":{description:"A large arrow 